    {
      "id": 493894,
      "username": "LukmanulHakkeem",
      "name": "Lukmanul Hakkeem",
      "created_at": "2026-02-10T11:25:06.142Z",
      "cooked": "<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Supplier must be foreign</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Supplier Country ≠ Company Country</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Purchase is marked as Import</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>In the <strong>Purchase Invoice</strong>, enable <strong>“Is Import”</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Purchase Invoice exists</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Bill of Entry is always linked to a <strong>Purchase Invoice</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Usually, the PI should be <strong>submitted</strong> before creating the BoE</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2><a name=\"p-493894-h-2-company-system-configuration-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493894-h-2-company-system-configuration-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>2. Company &amp; system configuration</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>India Compliance enabled</strong> (for GST users)</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>Accounts Settings → Enable India Compliance</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Customs Duty accounts set</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Customs Duty Ledger</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>CESS / IGST on Import (if applicable)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Chart of Accounts supports customs duties</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Default GST settings configured</strong> (if in India)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2><a name=\"p-493894-h-3-purchase-invoice-conditions-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493894-h-3-purchase-invoice-conditions-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>3. Purchase Invoice conditions</h2>\n<p>The Purchase Invoice must:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Be an <strong>Import Purchase Invoice</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Have:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Supplier</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Items</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Taxes structure suitable for imports</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Not already have a <strong>Bill of Entry submitted</strong> against it</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2><a name=\"p-493894-h-4-bill-of-entry-mandatory-fields-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493894-h-4-bill-of-entry-mandatory-fields-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>4. Bill of Entry mandatory fields</h2>\n<p>When creating the BoE:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Company</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Supplier</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Linked Purchase Invoice</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Bill of Entry Number</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Bill of Entry Date</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Port Code</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Bill of Entry Type (Home Consumption / Bond, etc.)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Customs Duty, IGST, CESS amounts</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2><a name=\"p-493894-h-5-accounting-behavior-important-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493894-h-5-accounting-behavior-important-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>5. Accounting behavior (important)</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>On <strong>submission</strong>, Bill of Entry:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Books <strong>customs duty &amp; IGST</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Adjusts the tax impact of the Purchase Invoice</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You <strong>cannot submit multiple BoEs</strong> for the same Purchase Invoice<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/d/3/d3b5d102bb62a1c76222f9d8e8ca8ee43cb7bd59.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/d3b5d102bb62a1c76222f9d8e8ca8ee43cb7bd59\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/3/d3b5d102bb62a1c76222f9d8e8ca8ee43cb7bd59_2_690x463.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"ucShKbmk51nY8e8airhVeQOcijT\" width=\"690\" height=\"463\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/3/d3b5d102bb62a1c76222f9d8e8ca8ee43cb7bd59_2_690x463.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/3/d3b5d102bb62a1c76222f9d8e8ca8ee43cb7bd59_2_1035x694.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/d/3/d3b5d102bb62a1c76222f9d8e8ca8ee43cb7bd59.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FCFCFC\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1345×903 53.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/c/5c79211f58857c535a0f942a274a1e40f6e16f9f.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/5c79211f58857c535a0f942a274a1e40f6e16f9f\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/c/5c79211f58857c535a0f942a274a1e40f6e16f9f_2_678x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"dc3rDCqYgTGYRKgjwKGrbXi3iuH\" width=\"678\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/c/5c79211f58857c535a0f942a274a1e40f6e16f9f_2_678x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/c/5c79211f58857c535a0f942a274a1e40f6e16f9f_2_1017x750.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/c/5c79211f58857c535a0f942a274a1e40f6e16f9f.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FCFCFC\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1221×900 56.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/5/e514d07ceef9376735744d48076cdf42d62936af.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/e514d07ceef9376735744d48076cdf42d62936af\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/5/e514d07ceef9376735744d48076cdf42d62936af_2_690x448.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"wGxVZEhldaZWpQhn6SIQyyoKU6b\" width=\"690\" height=\"448\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/5/e514d07ceef9376735744d48076cdf42d62936af_2_690x448.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/5/e514d07ceef9376735744d48076cdf42d62936af_2_1035x672.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/5/e514d07ceef9376735744d48076cdf42d62936af.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FCFCFC\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1316×856 55.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
