      "name": "Nitesh Sureka",
      "created_at": "2026-02-12T04:24:20.706Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thanks for the response . but i have checked this part .</p>\n<p>The issue is the supplier is not overseas but a SEZ , When indian supplier purchases from a SEZ even though the supplier is not overseas it is entitled to file Bill of entry.</p>\n<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/lukmanulhakkeem\">@LukmanulHakkeem</a></p>",
